  guide_h: "Getting Started — The Learning Order",
  guide_lead: "You can start aromatherapy simply by buying one bottle of a scent you like, but progressing in the order basics → individual oils → practice → blending builds both safety and enjoyment. The four steps below are this site's learning guide. Start from the introductory article of each step.",
