  profile_bio: "I started this site in response to the many people I have met over years of clinical practice who wanted to know what care they could do at home. It is not a substitute for treatment, but I share small hints for bringing scent, bathing and self-care goods into daily life, drawing on knowledge of Oriental medicine and how the body works. If you have symptoms that concern you, I recommend consulting a medical professional first.",
